{"id":"b4f98ecd268d0aa3","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-filter-selective-ultrafilter.md","title":"ZFC Filter Selective Ultrafilter","display":"df-zfc-filter-selective-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter Selective Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter-selective-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter-selective-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter-selective-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter Selective Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[./58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[./58-df-constant.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter-selective-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter-selective-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter-selective-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter Selective Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"./58-df-ultrafilter.md\">58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e88f14e27e51fd2e\" href=\"?note=e88f14e27e51fd2e\" title=\"./58-df-constant.md\">58-df-constant.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md\">../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V,\\quad \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(U\\in V,\\quad \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"./58-df-ultrafilter.md\">58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\upharpoonright A\">\\(f\\upharpoonright A\\)</span> is function restriction (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md\">../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Constant}_S\\subseteq V^2,\\quad \\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Constant}_S\\subseteq V^2,\\quad \\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e88f14e27e51fd2e\" href=\"?note=e88f14e27e51fd2e\" title=\"./58-df-constant.md\">58-df-constant.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveUltrafilter}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveUltrafilter}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}selective\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveUltrafilter}_S(U) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\to\n\\exists A\\in U\\;(\\mathrm{Constant}_S(f\\upharpoonright A,A)\\lor\n\\mathrm{Injective}(f\\upharpoonright A,A,\\omega))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}selective\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveUltrafilter}_S(U) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\to\n\\exists A\\in U\\;(\\mathrm{Constant}_S(f\\upharpoonright A,A)\\lor\n\\mathrm{Injective}(f\\upharpoonright A,A,\\omega))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Selectivity uses the exact upstream ternary injection predicate; no nonexistent injection alias is introduced.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-constant.md","status":"resolved","id":"e88f14e27e51fd2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-constant.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":